        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 25 at 3:34PM AKDT until September 26 at 5:00PM AKDT by NWS Juneau AK</headline>
        <description>Coastal Waters Forecast for Yakutat Bay

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent the average of the highest
one-third of the combined windwave and swell height.

.TONIGHT...E wind 15 kt. Seas 4 ft building to 7 ft late. Rain in
the evening.
.SAT...NE wind 25 kt. Seas 10 ft. Rain.
.SAT NIGHT...E wind 20 kt. Seas 9 ft. Rain.
.SUN...E wind 25 kt. Seas 8 ft. Rain.
.SUN NIGHT...E wind 20 kt. Seas 8 ft. Showers.
.MON...E wind 20 kt. Seas 8 ft.
.TUE...E wind 10 kt. Seas 5 ft.
.WED...E wind 15 kt. Seas 6 ft.
</description>
